  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>You may remember the fun broccoli apron I wore in my “In the Kitchen” videos (<a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/dr-greger-in-the-kitchen-my-new-favorite-dessert/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a> and <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/dr-greger-in-the-kitchen-my-new-favorite-beverage/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>). These aprons are back by popular demand, along with a fun new t-shirt and sweatshirt, designed by our talented summer intern (thank you, Bryan!). </p>\n<p>Support the continued nonprofit work of NutritionFacts.org and look cruciferocious at the same time! This limited-time fundraiser runs through October 4. Get your swag at <a href=\"http://bit.ly/NutritionFactscollection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://bit.ly/NutritionFactscollection</a>. </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Now on Facebook Watch</h4>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-55608 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/Facebook-Watch-Mockup-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/Facebook-Watch-Mockup-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/Facebook-Watch-Mockup-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/Facebook-Watch-Mockup-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/Facebook-Watch-Mockup-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/Facebook-Watch-Mockup.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/Facebook-Watch-Mockup-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/Facebook-Watch-Mockup-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>If you follow NutritionFacts.org on Facebook, you might have noticed a few changes in the way our page looks. That’s because we are now a Watch page. Facebook saw that our primary content was video and invited us to convert over. Now if you follow us there, you’ll be notified when new episodes are added, while still seeing all of our great non-video content. </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Calling More Volunteers</h4>\n<div><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-55138 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/08/VolunteerGraphic_Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/08/VolunteerGraphic_Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/08/VolunteerGraphic_Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/08/VolunteerGraphic_Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/08/VolunteerGraphic_Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/08/VolunteerGraphic_Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/08/VolunteerGraphic_Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/08/VolunteerGraphic_Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/08/VolunteerGraphic_Square.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>We are seeking volunteers experienced in translating into Sanskrit-Hindi to help make our videos more accessible to the Indian community and also looking for volunteers fluent in Mandarin with a medical or nutrition background to help answer questions on our Chinese Social Media profiles. For more information and to apply, visit <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/volunteer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NutritionFacts.org/volunteer</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Federal Employee CFC</h4>\n<div><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-55606\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/CFC_ApprovedCharity_CMYK-1024x732.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"143\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/CFC_ApprovedCharity_CMYK-1024x732.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/CFC_ApprovedCharity_CMYK-960x686.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/CFC_ApprovedCharity_CMYK-768x549.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/CFC_ApprovedCharity_CMYK-1200x857.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/CFC_ApprovedCharity_CMYK-720x514.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/CFC_ApprovedCharity_CMYK-540x386.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/09/CFC_ApprovedCharity_CMYK.png 1471w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>Are you a federal worker? You can show some love for evidence-based nutrition by giving to NutritionFacts.org through the CFC workplace giving program. Be sure to look for us in the upcoming enrollment period, with designation number 26461.</div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Live Q&amp;A TODAY</h4>\n<div><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-53879 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/>Every month now I do Q&amp;As live from my treadmill, and <em><strong>today, Sept 27</strong></em> is the day.</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook Live</strong>: At 12:00 p.m. ET TODAY go to our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3Dafe9299fd2%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEIgGkyjkXIfYHCVfz6o5PQOxSkhw\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook page</a> to watch live and ask questions.</li>\n<li><strong>YouTube Live Stream: </strong>At 1:00 p.m. ET TODAY go <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_q2eeExzqA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3D88539af304%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEvfR6sb4jzTlryjwFO0t9k3RiaJA\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_q2eeExzqA\">here</a> to watch live and ask even more questions! </li>\n</ul>\n<div>You can now find links to all of my past live YouTube and Facebook Q&amp;As right <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. If that’s not enough, remember I have an audio podcast to keep you company at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913&amp;id=9c5c1ac6dc&amp;e=545b7f785a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u%3Dc1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913%26id%3D9c5c1ac6dc%26e%3D545b7f785a&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1516314018432000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGoL2STvivkREYbL3IbSQpGMo_YSw\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/track/click?u=c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913&amp;id=9c5c1ac6dc&amp;e=545b7f785a\">https://nutritionfacts.org/audio.</a></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<p>In health,</p>\n<p><b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><u><b>here</b></u></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><u><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><u><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><u><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><u><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><u><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></u></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>"
